# Fist of the Forest
# Ability Name			Unique Key								Category of Ability		Type																Required Deity		Required Skill																		Define					Innate Spells									Description																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																							Auto Weapon Prof			Ability																																																											Bonus Ability Pool							Combat bonus												Add to base move																	Save bonus																																				Bonus to skill					Modify VAR																			Source Page		Temporary Bonus
AC Bonus				KEY:Fist of the Forest ~ AC Bonus				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Fist of the Forest Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:While unarmored, you gain a bonus to your Armor Class equal to your Constitution bonus (if any). See the monk class feature (PH 40).																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																													BONUS:COMBAT|AC|CON|PREVAREQ:ENCUMBERANCE,0,var("COUNT[EQTYPE.ARMOR.EQUIPPED]"),0																																																																																				SOURCEPAGE:p.80
Fast Movement			KEY:Fist of the Forest ~ Fast Movement			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Fist of the Forest Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:Your base land speed is faster than the norm for your race. See the barbarian class feature (PH 25). If you already have fast movement from another class, the bonuses to your speed stack.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																	BONUS:MOVEADD|TYPE=Walk|10|TYPE=FastMove.STACK|PREVARLT:ENCUMBERANCE,2,var("COUNT[EQTYPE.ARMOR.IS.HEAVY]"),1																																																																	SOURCEPAGE:p.80
Feral Trance			KEY:Fist of the Forest ~ Feral Trance			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Fist of the Forest Class Feature.SpecialQuality																											DEFINE:FeralTranceActive|0													DESC:Once per day, you can enter a feral battle trance. While you are in this state, the raw power of the beast flows through you. Your hands and feet become clawlike (destroying any shoes or gloves you are wearing), and your teeth lengthen and grow pointed. For the duration of the trance, you gain a +4 bonus to Dexterity and a +2 bonus on damage rolls with your unarmed strikes. You can also make one bite attack per round at your highest attack bonus whenever you attack as a full-round action. The damage for this attack is 1d6 + your Str modifier, regardless of your size. A feral trance lasts for a number of rounds equal to 3 + your Con modifier. While in a trance, you cannot perform certain actions, and afterward you are fatigued. These restrictions are the same as those for the barbarian's rage class feature (PH 25-26). If you have the ability to enter a rage, you can do so while in a feral trance, using your increased Constitution score to determine the duration of both effects. At 3rd level, you can use this ability twice per day.																																																																																																																																														ABILITY:Internal|AUTOMATIC|Feral Trance Active|PREVAREQ:FeralTranceActive,1																																																																																																																																																											SOURCEPAGE:p.80	TEMPBONUS:PC|STAT|DEX|4	TEMPBONUS:PC|COMBAT|DAMAGE.Unarmed|2	TEMPBONUS:PC|VAR|FeralTranceActive|1
Primal Living			KEY:Fist of the Forest ~ Primal Living			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Fist of the Forest Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:To maintain your bestial powers, you must live like a wild animal. You must sleep in natural environments, never inside buildings, unless forced by circumstances . Furthermore, you cannot purchase food-you must obtain it by hunting, gathering, begging, or stealing. Some fists of the forest even give up speech, the use of fire and tools, and all possessions, but such extremes are not required. In any month in which you buy food or voluntarily sleep indoors more than three times, all your fist of the forest class features cease to function until you have spent thirty consecutive days living like an animal once more, or until a fellow Guardian of the Green casts atonement on you.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																	SOURCEPAGE:p.81
# Formula Parser would handle this better. UA complex
Unarmed Damage			KEY:Fist of the Forest ~ Unarmed Damage			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Fist of the Forest Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:Your unarmed attacks deal more damage than usual. At 1st level, you deal 1d8 points of damage with each unarmed strike. When you attain 3rd level, this damage increases to 1d10 points. See the monk class feature (PH 41). If your unarmed attack already deals this amount of damage, increase the base damage to the next step indicated on the monk class table.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																	ABILITY:Internal|AUTOMATIC|Monk ~ Unarmed Damage																																																																																																																																																															SOURCEPAGE:p.81
Uncanny Dodge			KEY:Fist of the Forest ~ Uncanny Dodge			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Fist of the Forest Class Feature.SpecialQuality.Uncanny Dodge																																										DESC:At 2nd level, you cannot be caught flat-footed, and you react to danger before your senses would normally allow you to do so. See the barbarian class feature (PH 26). If you already have uncanny dodge from another class, you instead gain improved uncanny dodge.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																								SOURCEPAGE:p.81
Untamed Strike			KEY:Fist of the Forest ~ Untamed Strike			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Fist of the Forest Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:On attaining 2nd level, you can channel the untamed power of nature when you attack. Your unarmed strikes are treated as magic weapons; see the monk's ki strike class feature (PH 41). If your unarmed strikes are already magical, they instead are treated lesser ghost touch weapons. They deal full damage against incorporeal creatures 50%% of the time and half damage the rest of the time.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																			SOURCEPAGE:p.81
Scent					KEY:Fist of the Forest ~ Scent				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Fist of the Forest Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:Beginning at 3rd level, you gain the supernatural ability to detect approaching enemies, sniff out hidden foes, and track by sense of smell. This ability otherwise functions like the extraordinary ability of the same name (MM 314).																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																													SOURCEPAGE:p.81

# Forest Reeve
Earth's Defender			KEY:Forest Reeve ~ Earth's Defender				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Forest Reeve Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:Once per day as a move action, you can channel nature's power through your body and into any one weapon you wield, making it temporarily magical for 1 minute/character level you possess. When you are 1st level, this ability grants your weapon a temporary +1 bonus. The value of this bonus increases to +2 when you attain 3rd level and to +3 when you attain 5th level. The ability can be used while you wield a magic weapon, but its effects do not stack with the weapon's existing bonus (if any).																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																	SOURCEPAGE:p.82
Fast Movement			KEY:Forest Reeve ~ Fast Movement				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Forest Reeve Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:Your base land speed is 10 feet faster than the norm for your race. See the barbarian class feature (PH 25). If you have fast movement from another source, the benefits stack.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																			BONUS:MOVEADD|TYPE=Walk|10|TYPE=FastMove.STACK|PREVARLT:ENCUMBERANCE,2,var("COUNT[EQTYPE.ARMOR.IS.HEAVY]"),1																																																																	SOURCEPAGE:p.82
Nature's Rejuvenation		KEY:Forest Reeve ~ Nature's Rejuvenation			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike.Class Feature.Forest Reeve Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																														DESC:Once per day, you can channel the rejuvenating power of nature to restore or invigorate yourself. If you spend 1 full minute in direct physical contact with a living plant or fertile ground, you are affected as if by your choice of any one of the following spells: bear's endurance, cure moderate wounds, or lesser restoration (caster level equals your character level). You can use this power only on yourself. At 3rd level, you can use this ability twice per day, and at 5th level, you can use it three times per day.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																													SOURCEPAGE:p.82
Woodland Stride			KEY:Forest Reeve ~ Woodland Stride				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Forest Reeve Class Feature.SpecialQuality.Woodland Stride																																										DESC:Beginning at 2nd level, you can move through natural overgrown areas at normal speed without damage. See the druid class feature (PH 36). If you already have woodland stride, you gain a +10-foot bonus to your land speed.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																												BONUS:MOVEADD|TYPE=Walk|10|PREABILITY:2,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.Woodland Stride																																																																					SOURCEPAGE:p.82
Swift Tracker			KEY:Forest Reeve ~ Swift Tracker				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Forest Reeve Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:Beginning at 3rd level, you can move at your normal speed while following tracks. See the ranger class feature (PH 48). If you have swift tracker from another source, the penalties are lessened by an additional 5 feet.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																															SOURCEPAGE:p.82
Camouflage				KEY:Forest Reeve ~ Camouflage					CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Forest Reeve Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:Beginning at 4th level, you can use the Hide skill in any sort of natural terrain, even while being observed.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																	SOURCEPAGE:p.82
Whispers of the Forest		KEY:Forest Reeve ~ Whispers of the Forest			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Forest Reeve Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:When you attain 5th level, the plants, trees, and rocks begin to speak to you, bringing you news wherever you are. Once per day, these voices of the forest give you a short answer to any simple question you pose pertaining to current events in any wilderness area on your land mass. Questions about distant lands require 1 minute per mile of distance to answer. At the DM's discretion, when the forest deems an issue particularly important, the whispers bring you news without your request.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																		SOURCEPAGE:p.82

# Holt Warden
Spellcasting			KEY:Holt Warden ~ Spellcasting				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Holt Warden Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																																DESC:At each level, you gain new spells per day and an increase in caster level (and spells known, if applicable) as if you had also gained a level in a divine spellcasting class to which you belonged before adding the prestige class level. You do not, however, gain any other benefit a character of that class would have gained. If you had more than one divine spellcasting class before becoming a holt warden, you must decide to which class to add each level for the purpose of determining spells per day, caster level, and spells known.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																											SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Nature Sense			KEY:Holt Warden ~ Nature Sense				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Holt Warden Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:You gain a +2 bonus on Knowledge (nature) and Survival checks. If you already have nature sense, the bonuses double.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Plant Affinity			KEY:Holt Warden ~ Plant Affinity				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Holt Warden Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:You are magically attuned to plants. If you prepare your spells in advance and do not have the spontaneous casting ability (as the cleric and druid spellcasting feature, see PH 32 and 35), you can now spontaneously trade prepared spells for spells of an equal or lower level from the Plant domain. If you do have a spontaneous casting ability, you can exchange that one for the ability to cast spontaneously from the Plant domain. Once you make that decision, it cannot be reversed. If you do not already have bonus domain spells, you now gain bonus spells from the Plant domain (see the cleric spellcasting feature, PH 32) as if you were a cleric with access to that domain. If you already have domain spells, they are unaffected by this power.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																							SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Rebuke Plants			KEY:Holt Warden ~ Rebuke Plants				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Holt Warden Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:Beginning at 2nd level, you can channel the power of your faith through your holy symbol to rebuke or command plant creatures as though you were a cleric of your holt warden level rebuking undead. See the cleric class feature rebuke undead (PH 33), and the Plant Domain granted power (PH 188).																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																			SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Woodland Stride			KEY:Holt Warden ~ Woodland Stride				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Holt Warden Class Feature.SpecialQuality.Woodland Stride																																											DESC:Beginning at 2nd level, you can move through natural overgrown areas at normal speed without damage. See the druid class feature (PH 36). If you already have woodland stride, you gain a +10 bonus to your land speed.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																													BONUS:MOVEADD|TYPE=Walk|10|PREABILITY:2,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.Woodland Stride																																																																					SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Earth's Communion			KEY:Holt Warden ~ Earth's Communion				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike.Class Feature.Holt Warden Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																														DESC:At 3rd level, you learn to heal and replenish yourself and others by communing with the earth once per day. At the end of 10 full minutes of concentration (as the skill), you are affected as if by a heal spell (PH 239). If you so choose, you can allow others to sit with you in a circle, holding hands, during your communion. In that case, you can choose to divide the hit points and other benefits provided by your communion among the people in the circle. You can divide hit points as if you were using the paladin class feature lay on hands (PH 44). Each other benefit of the heal spell can affect only one person in the circle, at your direction. Thus, only one person can be cured of blindness, and so forth. You do not gain the advantages of any healing benefits that you distribute to others. You can use this ability twice per day at 5th level, three times per day at 7th level, and four times per day at 9th level.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																										SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Trackless Step			KEY:Holt Warden ~ Trackless Step				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Holt Warden Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:Beginning at 3rd level, you cannot be tracked in natural surroundings. See the druid class feature (PH 36). If you already have trackless step, you instead gain a +4 bonus on Hide and Move Silently checks while in natural surroundings.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																												SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Venom Immunity			KEY:Holt Warden ~ Venom Immunity				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Holt Warden Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At 5th level, you gain immunity to all poisons.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																												SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Whispers of the Forest		KEY:Holt Warden ~ Whispers of the Forest			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Holt Warden Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:When you attain 6th level, the plants, trees, and rocks begin to speak to you, bringing you news wherever you are. Once per day for every three holt warden levels you possess, the voices of the forest give you a short answer to any simple question you pose pertaining to current events in any wilderness area on your land mass. Questions about distant lands require 1 minute per mile of distance to answer. At the DM's discretion, when the forest deems an issue particularly important, the whispers bring you news without your request. When you attain 10th level, the spiritual energy of the forest can give you insights into other beings as well. Once per day, you can ask the voices of the forest about a single creature. For the rest of that day, you gain a +8 insight bonus on all Bluff, Diplomacy, Intimidate, and Sense Motive checks pertaining to that creature. Again, at the DM's discretion, the forest might occasionally volunteer information about a person or creature, but only if it considers the being remarkable in some way.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																							SOURCEPAGE:p.84
Web of Life				KEY:Holt Warden ~ Web of Life					CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike.Class Feature.Holt Warden Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																														DESC:At 7th level, you can lead your community in spiritual union with the interconnected web of all life. Once per day, when you sing, chant, or speak inspiringly for at least 1 full minute, every living creature that hears your voice gains a +2 bonus to Wisdom for the next 1d4 hours. In addition, each divine spellcaster who hears you, including yourself, gains back 1d4 levels of spells (up to four 1st-level spells, two 2nd-level spells, one 3rd-level and one 1st-level, or one 4th-level spell). These regained spells must be spells you've cast since you last prepared spells. No spellcaster can be affected by this spell-regaining ability more than once per day, even if it is activated by multiple holt wardens.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																													SOURCEPAGE:p.85
Timeless Body			KEY:Holt Warden ~ Timeless Body				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Holt Warden Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:Beginning at 9th level, you no longer age. See the druid class feature (PH 37). If you already have timeless body, you can choose an extra feat instead.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																										SOURCEPAGE:p.85

# Mythic Exemplar
Spellcasting			KEY:Mythic Exemplar ~ Spellcasting				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Mythic Exemplar Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																															DESC:At 2nd, 4th, 6th, and 8th level, you gain new spells per day and an increase in caster level (and spells known, if applicable) as if you had also gained a level in a spellcasting class to which you belonged before adding the prestige class level. You do not, however, gain any other benefit a character of that class would have gained. If you had more than one spellcasting class before becoming a mythic exemplar, you must decide to which class to add each level for the purpose of determining spells per day, caster level, and spells known. If your paragon is Imdastri or Ktolemagne, you gain additional levels of spellcasting ability through the archetype advancement class features (see below).																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																															SOURCEPAGE:p.86
Paragon's Path			KEY:Mythic Exemplar ~ Paragon's Path			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Mythic Exemplar Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																															DESC:Upon becoming a mythic exemplar, you must choose one of the legendary Six from Shadow upon whom to model your skills and abilities. Your choices are the clever Dardallion, the faithful Imdastri, the all-knowing Ktolemagne, the inexorable Orsos, the noble and inspirational Sir Reikhardt, and the mighty Sunyartra. Once made, your choice cannot be changed.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																								SOURCEPAGE:p.87
Save Bonus				KEY:Mythic Exemplar ~ Save Bonus				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Mythic Exemplar Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At 1st level, you gain a +1 bonus on a saving throw determined by your paragon, as given on the following table. This bonus increases by 1 at every oddnumbered level up to 7th.	DESC:&nl;Patron Saving Throw	DESC:&nl;Dardallion Reflex	DESC:&nl;Imdastri Will	DESC:&nl;Ktolemagne Will	DESC:&nl;Orsos Fortitude	DESC:&nl;Reikhardt Will	DESC:&nl;Sunyartra Fortitude																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																					SOURCEPAGE:p.87
Paragon's Gift, Least		KEY:Mythic Exemplar ~ Paragon's Gift (Least)		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Mythic Exemplar Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At 2nd level, you gain the first of several supernatural abilities that allow you to channel the spirit and skills of your paragon. Unless otherwise noted, each paragon's gift (least, lesser, greater, and supreme) requires a swift action to invoke, lasts for a number of rounds equal to your mythic exemplar level, is usable once per day, and has a caster level equal to your mythic exemplar level.	DESC:&nl;Dardallion: You gain a +5 insight bonus on Disable Device, Hide, Move Silently, and Open Lock checks.	DESC:&nl;Imdastri: As an immediate action, you can reroll one attack roll, save, or check per day, as if using the granted power of the Luck domain (PH 187). This effect occurs instantaneously.	DESC:&nl;Ktolemagne: You gain a +5 sacred bonus on Concentration, Decipher Script, Knowledge (arcana), and Spellcraft checks.	DESC:&nl;Orsos: You gain a +20-foot insight bonus to your base speed.	DESC:&nl;Reikhardt: You can use inspire courage as a bard of your mythic exemplar level. If you already have this ability, your mythic exemplar levels stack with levels of the class that provided it for the purpose of determining its effects.	DESC:&nl;Sunyartra: The critical threat range of one weapon you wield increases by 1. This increase stacks with those from other sources, such as the keen weapon property or the Improved Critical feat.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																	SOURCEPAGE:p.87
Archetype Advancement		KEY:Mythic Exemplar ~ Archetype Advancement		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Mythic Exemplar Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At 3rd, 5th, 7th, and 9th levels, you gain a class feature that builds on those of your paragon. If your archetype advancement grants bonus feats, you must meet all the normal prerequisites for your selections, unless otherwise noted.	DESC:&nl;Dardallion: You gain sneak attack. See the rogue class feature (PH 50). You gain another 1d6 points of sneak attack damage each time you select this feature.	DESC:&nl;Imdastri: You gain +1 level of an existing divine spellcasting class.	DESC:&nl;Ktolemagne: You gain +1 level of an existing arcane spellcasting class.	DESC:&nl;Orsos: You gain bonuses against the favored enemies of Orsos. At each of these levels, you gain a +2 favored enemy bonus against either aberrations or chaotic outsiders (your choice). You need not choose the same enemy each time. This bonus stacks with any favored enemy bonuses you might already possess.	DESC:&nl;Reikhardt: You gain +1 level of a class-based extraordinary ability to grant bonuses to allies (such as a marshal's auras).	DESC:&nl;Sunyartra: You gain a +1 bonus on all opposed Strength checks (such as those made on bull rushes or trip attacks), as well as all Strength-based skill checks.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																													SOURCEPAGE:p.87
Paragon's Gift, Lesser		KEY:Mythic Exemplar ~ Paragon's Gift (Lesser)		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Mythic Exemplar Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At 4th level, you gain a new supernatural ability that you can use once per day, according to your paragon as given on the following table. This ability follows all the guidelines for least paragon's gift (above), unless otherwise noted. If you choose, you can forgo your daily use of this ability for an extra use of the least gift.	DESC:&nl;Paragon Ability	DESC:&nl;Dardallion +4 insight bonus to Dexterity	DESC:&nl;Imdastri +4 insight bonus to Wisdom	DESC:&nl;Ktolemagne +4 insight bonus to Intelligence	DESC:&nl;Orsos +4 insight bonus to Constitution	DESC:&nl;Reikhardt +4 insight bonus to Charisma	DESC:&nl;Sunyartra +4 insight bonus to Strength																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																					SOURCEPAGE:p.88
Paragon's Gift, Greater		KEY:Mythic Exemplar ~ Paragon's Gift (Greater)		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Mythic Exemplar Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At 6th level, you gain a new supernatural ability that you can use once per day. This ability follows all the guidelines for least paragon's gift (above), unless otherwise noted. If you choose, you can forgo your daily use of this ability for an extra use of your least or lesser gift.	DESC:&nl;Dardallion: You can use blink, as the spell.	DESC:&nl;Imdastri: As an immediate action, you can invoke temporary immunity to mind-affecting spells and abilities. This immunity does not extend to effects whose caster level exceeds your character level by 4 or more.	DESC:&nl;Ktolemagne: You can use identify, as the spell, except that the casting time is 1 minute, and you need no material component.	DESC:&nl;Orsos: You gain a +4 bonus to your natural armor bonus.	DESC:&nl;Reikhardt: You can use inspire greatness as a bard of your mythic exemplar level. If you already have this ability, your mythic exemplar levels stack with levels of the class that provided it for the purpose of determining its effects.	DESC:&nl;Sunyartra: You can use haste, as the spell, on yourself only.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																															SOURCEPAGE:p.88
Paragon's Gift, Supreme		KEY:Mythic Exemplar ~ Paragon's Gift (Supreme)		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Mythic Exemplar Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At 8th level, you gain a new supernatural ability that you can use once per day. This ability follows all the guidelines for least paragon's gift (above), unless otherwise noted. If you choose, you can forgo your daily use of this ability for an extra use of your least, lesser, or greater gift.	DESC:&nl;Dardallion: You can use greater invisibility, as the spell, on yourself only.	DESC:&nl;Imdastri: As an immediate action, you can invoke temporary immunity to necromantic and death effects. This immunity does not extend to effects whose caster level exceeds your character level by 4 or more.	DESC:&nl;Ktolemagne: You gain temporary spell resistance equal to 10 + your arcane caster level.	DESC:&nl;Orsos: You can use air walk, as the spell, on yourself only.	DESC:&nl;Reikhardt: You can use dominate person, as the spell.	DESC:&nl;Sunyartra: You can use divine power, as the spell.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																													SOURCEPAGE:p.88
Ability Boost			KEY:Mythic Exemplar ~ Ability Boost				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Mythic Exemplar Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At 10th level, one of your ability scores permanently increases by 2, according to your paragon as given on the following table.	DESC:&nl;Paragon Ability Score	DESC:&nl;Dardallion Dexterity	DESC:&nl;Imdastri Wisdom	DESC:&nl;Ktolemagne Intelligence	DESC:&nl;Orsos Constitution	DESC:&nl;Reikhardt Charisma	DESC:&nl;Sunyartra Strength																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																									SOURCEPAGE:p.88
Embody Paragon			KEY:Mythic Exemplar ~ Embody Paragon			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Mythic Exemplar Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:When you reach 10th level, you truly embody every physical and spiritual concept that your paragon stood for. Unless otherwise noted, the ability you gain is permanent and constant, as long as you remain conscious. If it is suppressed, you can raise the effect again as a swift action.	DESC:&nl;Dardallion: You can turn incorporeal (DMG 294) for up to 1 minute per day. This duration need not be used all at once and can be divided into intervals as short as 1 round. Shifting to or from incorporeality requires a move action.	DESC:&nl;Imdastri: You can "lose" a prepared divine spell in exchange for a spell of lower level from the Luck, Protection, or Strength domains, much as a good cleric can spontaneously cast cure spells. You do not gain the domain power or the ability to prepare these spells as domain spells.	DESC:&nl;Ktolemagne: You can "lose" a prepared arcane spell in exchange for any divination spell of lower level that is already in your spellbook.	DESC:&nl;Orsos: You gain a +4 bonus on any saves or rolls made to resist fatigue and exhaustion. In addition, you are under a permanent freedom of movement effect, unless the spell level of the impeding effect exceeds your character level.	DESC:&nl;Reikhardt: Select either Fortitude or Will saves. From this point on, you (and all allies within 60 feet) gain a circumstance bonus equal to your Charisma modifier on this saving throw. Once made, this choice cannot be changed. In addition, for 10 rounds per day, you can grant yourself and each ally within 60 feet damage reduction 2/-. This benefit does not stack with any other damage reduction you or your allies possess. This ability requires a swift action to activate.	DESC:&nl;Sunyartra: You can ignore 15 points of damage reduction (except epic) when attacking foes, and 15 points of hardness when striking inanimate objects.																																																																																																																																																																													SOURCEPAGE:p.88

# Ordained Champion
Spellcasting			KEY:Ordained Champion ~ Spellcasting			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Ordained Champion Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																															DESC:At 2nd, 3rd, and 5th level, you gain new spells per day and an increase in caster level (and spells known, if applicable) as if you had also gained a level in a divine spellcasting class to which you belonged before adding the prestige class level. You do not, however, gain any other benefit a character of that class would have gained. If you had more than one divine spellcasting class before becoming an ordained champion, you must decide to which class to add each level for the purpose of determining spells per day, caster level, and spells known.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																							SOURCEPAGE:p.90
Bonus Domain			KEY:Ordained Champion ~ Bonus Domain			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Ordained Champion Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																															DESC:If you are a cleric, you gain the War domain as a third domain. If you already have the War domain, you can instead choose any other domain granted by your deity as your third domain. If you have no cleric levels, you can add the War domain spells to your class spell list, but you do not gain its domain ability or any extra spell slots for domain spells.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																								SOURCEPAGE:p.90	BONUS:VAR|DomainCount|1|PRECLASS:1,Cleric=1	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Ordained Champion War Domain|1|!PRECLASS:1,Cleric=1	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Grant Domain ~ War|PRECLASS:1,Cleric=1
Combat Feats			KEY:Ordained Champion ~ Combat Feats			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Ordained Champion Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																															DESC:You can permanently sacrifice one or two of your domain granted powers to acquire an equal number of feats from the list of fighter bonus feats, as long as you meet the prerequisites for them. You may not sacrifice your War domain ability for this purpose. You must choose whether or not to make this exchange when you first become an ordained champion, and you cannot later change your mind.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																		SOURCEPAGE:p.90	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Sacrifice Domain|1
Continued Advancement		KEY:Ordained Champion ~ Continued Advancement		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Ordained Champion Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																															DESC:Levels in ordained champion stack with levels of other appropriate classes for the purpose of turning or rebuking undead, and for all level-dependent domain granted powers.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																							SOURCEPAGE:p.90	BONUS:VAR|TurnLevelBase|OrdainedChampionLVL
Modified Spontaneous Casting	KEY:Ordained Champion ~ Modified Spontaneous Casting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Ordained Champion Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:If you have cleric levels, you lose the ability to spontaneously cast cure or inflict spells. Instead, you can swap out previously prepared cleric spells for any spells of equal or lower level from the War domain. This alteration applies even to levels you gain as a cleric after becoming an ordained champion. If you are not a cleric, modified spontaneous casting does not apply to you, even if you can spontaneously cast some other kind of spell, such as summon nature's ally.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																				SOURCEPAGE:p.90
Diehard				KEY:Ordained Champion ~ Diehard				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Ordained Champion Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																															DESC:At 2nd level, you gain Diehard as a bonus feat, even if you lack the prerequisites. If you already have Diehard, you can select any other feat for which you meet the prerequisites as your bonus feat.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																		SOURCEPAGE:p.90
Smite					KEY:Ordained Champion ~ Smite					CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Ordained Champion Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:At 2nd level, you can spend one daily use of your turn/rebuke undead ability as a swift action to turn your next melee attack into a smite. You gain a bonus equal to your Charisma modifier on attack rolls, and you deal extra damage equal to your total effective turning or rebuking level. Your smite attack is not limited by alignment or race; you can attempt to smite any foe. Except as noted here, this ability functions like the paladin's smite evil ability (PH 44).																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																					SOURCEPAGE:p.90
Channel Spell			KEY:Ordained Champion ~ Channel Spell			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike.Class Feature.Ordained Champion Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At 3rd level, you can channel any spell you have available to cast into your melee weapon. Doing so requires a move action and uses up a prepared spell or spell slot just as if you had cast the spell. The channeled spell affects the next target you successfully attack with that weapon, though saving throws and spell resistance still apply normally. Even if the spell normally affects an area or is a ray, it still affects only the target in this case. On a successful hit, the spell is discharged from the weapon, which can then hold another spell. You can channel your spells into only one weapon at a time. A spell channeled into a weapon is lost if not used within 8 hours.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																			SOURCEPAGE:p.91
Divine Bulwark			KEY:Ordained Champion ~ Divine Bulwark			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike.Class Feature.Ordained Champion Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At 3rd level, you can sacrifice a prepared spell or spell slot as a swift action to gain damage reduction. The value of the damage reduction equals 1 + spell level sacrificed, and it can be overcome by a chaoticaligned strike. Thus, a 3rd-level ordained champion who sacrificed a flame strike spell would gain damage reduction 6/chaotic for 3 rounds. The damage reduction gained from multiple uses of this ability does not stack. This protection lasts for a number of rounds equal to your ordained champion level.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																														SOURCEPAGE:p.91
Fist of the Gods			KEY:Ordained Champion ~ Fist of the Gods			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike.Class Feature.Ordained Champion Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At 4th level, you can sacrifice a prepared spell or spell slot as a swift action to deal extra damage. Doing so grants you a bonus equal to 1 + spell level sacrificed on your damage rolls for melee attacks. This benefit lasts for a number of rounds equal to your ordained champion level.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																				SOURCEPAGE:p.91
Rapid Spontaneous Casting	KEY:Ordained Champion ~ Rapid Spontaneous Casting	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Ordained Champion Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:When you attain 4th level, any spell from the War domain that you spontaneously cast requires only a swift action if its normal casting time is no more than 1 standard action, or a standard action if its normal casting time is 1 full-round action. A spontaneous spell that you modify with a metamagic feat requires only its normal casting time rather than the extra time such a spell normally requires.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																	SOURCEPAGE:p.91
Holy Warrior			KEY:Ordained Champion ~ Holy Warrior			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike.Class Feature.Ordained Champion Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At 5th level, you can spend one daily use of your turn/rebuke undead ability as a swift action to bring your Wisdom into play in combat. For 5 rounds after you activate this ability, you can use your Wisdom modifier in place of your Strength modifier on attack rolls and damage rolls.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																				SOURCEPAGE:p.91
War Caster				KEY:Ordained Champion ~ War Caster				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Ordained Champion Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:At 5th level, you gain a +2 bonus to your effective caster level when casting spells that appear on the War domain spell list.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																															SOURCEPAGE:p.91

# Sacrifice Domain
No Domain Powers Sacrificed	TYPE:Sacrifice Domain	CATEGORY:Internal
1 Domain Powers Sacrificed	TYPE:Sacrifice Domain	CATEGORY:Internal	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Remove Domain Power|1	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Fighter Feat|count("ABILITIES","CATEGORY=Internal","TYPE=Remove Domain Power")
2 Domain Powers Sacrificed	TYPE:Sacrifice Domain	CATEGORY:Internal	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Remove Domain Power|2	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Fighter Feat|count("ABILITIES","CATEGORY=Internal","TYPE=Remove Domain Power")

War Domain				KEY:Grant Domain ~ War	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality	DESC:Granted War Domain by Class Feature

# War Domain Class Selection

Druid					KEY:War Domain Spells ~ Druid					CATEGORY:Internal	TYPE:Ordained Champion War Domain						SPELLLEVEL:CLASS|Druid=1|Magic Weapon|Druid=2|Spiritual Weapon|Druid=3|Magic Vestment|Druid=4|Divine Power|Druid=5|Flame Strike|Druid=6|Blade Barrier|Druid=7|Power Word Blind|Druid=8|Power Word Stun|Druid=9|Power Word Kill


# Paragnostic Apostle
Spellcasting			KEY:Paragnostic Apostle ~ Spellcasting			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Paragnostic Apostle Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																														DESC:At each level, you gain new spells per day and an increase in caster level (and spells known, if applicable) as if you had also gained a level in a spellcasting class to which you belonged before adding the prestige class level. You do not, however, gain any other benefit a character of that class would have gained. If you had more than one spellcasting class before becoming a paragnostic apostle, you must decide to which class to add each level for the purpose of determining spells per day, caster level, and spells known.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																												SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Holy Texts				KEY:Paragnostic Apostle ~ Holy Texts			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Paragnostic Apostle Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:Because of your study of sacred writings, your paragnostic apostle levels stack with other class levels for the purpose of turning or rebuking undead and leveldependent domain abilities. You do not gain such abilities if you do not already have them, however.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																								SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Knowledge Is Power		KEY:Paragnostic Apostle ~ Knowledge Is Power		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Paragnostic Apostle Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:At each level, you gain a spellcasting enhancement based on your Knowledge skills. Each time you gain this feature, choose one of the following abilities for which you meet the skill-based prerequisites. Although you can choose some of these abilities multiple times (as indicated in the descriptions), you may not select the same one twice in a row, and the minimum required skill rank increases by 2 for each subsequent selection of the same ability. These benefits apply to warlock invocations as well as spells, where applicable.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Knowledge Is Power|ParagnosticApostleLVL																																																																																																		SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Lore					KEY:Paragnostic Apostle ~ Lore				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Paragnostic Apostle Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:You can recall legends or information regarding various topics, just like a bard can with bardic knowledge. To use this ability, make a lore check (1d20 + twice your paragnostic apostle level + your Int modifier). Success grants you the same result as a bardic knowledge check would. If you have the bardic knowledge or lore ability from another class, your levels in those classes stack with your paragnostic apostle levels for the purpose of this check.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																								SOURCEPAGE:p.95
#
Accurate Retort			KEY:Knowledge Is Power ~ Accurate Retort			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Knowledge Is Power.SpecialQuality																																																	DESC:You gain a +1 circumstance bonus on your ranged attack roll with every ray spell that you aim at a creature with a natural armor bonus. (Knowledge [arcana] 8 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																								SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Backhanded Attack			KEY:Knowledge Is Power ~ Backhanded Attack		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Knowledge Is Power.SpecialQuality												PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Arcana)=6																																DESC:If you successfully hit with an attack that deals hit point or ability score damage and requires a saving throw against an additional, nondamaging effect (such as a warlock's beshadowed blastCAr or the orb of acidCAr spell), add 1 to the DC of the saving throw. (Knowledge [arcana] 6 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																			SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Call of Worlds			KEY:Knowledge Is Power ~ Call of Worlds			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Knowledge Is Power.SpecialQuality												PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (the Planes)=6																																DESC:Each creature you summon with a conjuration (summoning) spell gains the fast healing ability. The damage healed per round begins at 2 hit points and increases by 1 for every three caster levels (maximum +5 at 15th caster level). (Knowledge [the planes] 6 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																								SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Discern Weakness			KEY:Knowledge Is Power ~ Discern Weakness			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Knowledge Is Power.SpecialQuality																																																	DESC:Choose one creature type or subtype from the ranger's favored enemy list (PH 47). If you have 8 ranks in the appropriate Knowledge skill (such as Knowledge [arcana] for dragons, or Knowledge [nature] for humanoids), the save DC of every spell that you target on a creature of that type increases by 1. You can select this ability multiple times, choosing a different creature type each time.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																		SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Divine Understanding		KEY:Knowledge Is Power ~ Divine Understanding		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Knowledge Is Power.SpecialQuality												PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Religion)=5																																DESC:Choose one clerical domain. For the purpose of this ability, you can choose any domain, whether or not your deity offers it. Your effective caster level increases by 1 when you cast spells that appear on that domain's spell list. You can select this ability multiple times, choosing a different domain each time. (Knowledge [religion] 5 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																										SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Energy Supremacy			KEY:Knowledge Is Power ~ Energy Supremacy			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Knowledge Is Power.SpecialQuality												PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (the Planes)=5																																DESC:Choose an energy type from the following list: acid, cold, electricity, fire. Your effective caster level increases by 1 when you cast spells of that energy type. You can select this ability multiple times, choosing a different energy type each time. (Knowledge [the planes] 5 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																				SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Manifest Ethos			KEY:Knowledge Is Power ~ Manifest Ethos			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Knowledge Is Power.SpecialQuality												PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (religion)=8,Knowledge (the planes)=10																												DESC:Choose one non-neutral aspect of your own alignment (chaos, evil, good, or law). When you cast an energybased offensive spell against a creature with an opposing alignment component (chaos/law or good/evil), one-half the hit point damage dealt is pure divine power instead of its normal energy type, and thus not subject to reduction by energy resistance or immunity. You can select this ability multiple times, assuming that your alignment permits it, choosing a different aspect of your alignment each time. (Knowledge [religion] 8 ranks or [the planes] 10 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																					SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Mind over Body			KEY:Knowledge Is Power ~ Mind over Body			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Knowledge Is Power.SpecialQuality												PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Nature)=7,Knowledge (Religion)=7																												DESC:Your effective caster level increases by 1 when you cast conjuration (healing) spells or transmutation spells that grant ability bonuses or penalties. (Knowledge [nature or religion] 7 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																				SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Mind over Matter			KEY:Knowledge Is Power ~ Mind over Matter			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Knowledge Is Power.SpecialQuality												PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Architecture And Engineering)=5																													DESC:Whenever you cast a spell that creates a solid object, its hardness and hit points each increase by 2. When you cast a spell that provides an armor bonus, that bonus to AC also increases by 2. (Knowledge [architecture and engineering] 5 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																											SOURCEPAGE:p.95
#
Mortal Coil				KEY:Knowledge Is Power ~ Mortal Coil			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Knowledge Is Power.SpecialQuality												PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Nature)=6																																DESC:Your effective caster level increases by 1 when you cast spells that physically change the subject's form (such as alter self, enlarge person, or baleful polymorph). (Knowledge [nature] 6 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																			SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Noble Presence			KEY:Knowledge Is Power ~ Noble Presence			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Knowledge Is Power.SpecialQuality												PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Nobility and Royalty)=5																														DESC:Whenever you cast a charm spell, or a compulsion that affects the subject's emotions but not specific actions (such as good hope or rage, but not dominate person), the save DC increases by 1. (Knowledge [nobility and royalty] 5 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																													SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Penetrating Insight		KEY:Knowledge Is Power ~ Penetrating Insight		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Knowledge Is Power.SpecialQuality												PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Arcana)=9																																DESC:You gain a +1 bonus on caster level checks made to overcome spell resistance, or to successfully dispel another caster's spell. (Knowledge [arcana] 9 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																										SOURCEPAGE:p.95
See through the Veil		KEY:Knowledge Is Power ~ See through the Veil		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Knowledge Is Power.SpecialQuality												PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Religion)=7																																DESC:Whenever you cast a necromantic spell that targets undead, the save DC increases by 1. In addition, your effective turning level increases by 2, if you possess the ability to turn or rebuke undead. (Knowledge [religion] 7 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																														SOURCEPAGE:p.95
Spatial Awareness			KEY:Knowledge Is Power ~ Spatial Awareness		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Knowledge Is Power.SpecialQuality												PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Geography)=5																																DESC:Your effective caster level increases by 1 when you cast conjuration (teleportation) spells. Furthermore, the subject of any spell that increases base movement rate or grants a new type of movement gains an additional 10 feet to the designated speed. (Knowledge [geography] 5 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																					SOURCEPAGE:p.95
#

# Paragnostic Initiate
Assist Casting			KEY:Paragnostic Initiate ~ Assist Casting			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Paragnostic Initiate Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:You can assist an ally with spellcasting if you have a number of ranks in the appropriate Knowledge skill equal to the level of the spell being cast (minimum 1). The table below defines the required skills for each type of ally.	DESC:&nl;Ally Assisted Knowledge Skill	DESC:&nl;Arcane caster Knowledge (arcana)	DESC:&nl;Cleric or paladin Knowledge (religion)	DESC:&nl;Druid or ranger Knowledge (nature)	DESC:&nl;The type of assistance you can render varies with your level.	DESC:&nl;Penetration: Once per round as an immediate action, you can grant an adjacent allied spellcaster a +1 bonus on caster level checks made to overcome spell resistance.	DESC:&nl;Target: At 2nd level, you automatically aid any allied spellcasters in targeting a foe with which you are engaged in melee. Your ally does not take the standard -4 penalty for targeting that foe with a ranged attack spell, though the penalty remains in effect normally if other allies are engaged with that foe. In addition, you do not provide a cover bonus for that foe against any allied spellcasters. Furthermore, any foe you threaten takes a -1 penalty on Reflex saving throws against spells cast by your allies (but not by you).	DESC:&nl;Distraction: At 3rd level, you gain the ability to protect an allied spellcaster with whom you are flanking an opponent. As long as you maintain the flanking arrangement, your ally can cast spells without drawing attacks of opportunity from the flanked creature. Other activities that draw attacks of opportunity do so as normal.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																		SOURCEPAGE:p.97
Tactical Combat			KEY:Paragnostic Initiate ~ Tactical Combat		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Paragnostic Initiate Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:At each level you attain in this class, you gain an ability to enhance your fighting prowess or to influence magical effects cast upon you, based on your Knowledge skills. Each time you gain this feature, choose one of the following abilities for which you meet the skill-based prerequisites. Although you can choose some of these abilities multiple times (as indicated in the descriptions), you may not select the same one twice in a row, and the minimum required skill rank increases by 2 for each subsequent selection of the same ability.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																									SOURCEPAGE:p.98
#
Avoid Energy			KEY:Tactical Combat ~ Avoid Energy				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Tactical Combat Class Feature.SpecialQuality										PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (the Planes)=4	PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (the Planes)=4																										DESC:Choose an energy type from among acid, cold, electricity, and fire. You gain a +2 bonus on all saving throws made against spells that deal damage of that energy type. You can select this ability multiple times, choosing a different energy type each time. (Knowledge [the planes] 4 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																				SOURCEPAGE:p.98
Break Point				KEY:Tactical Combat ~ Break Point				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Tactical Combat Class Feature.SpecialQuality										PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (architecture and engineering)=4	PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (architecture and engineering)=4																				DESC:Each of your melee attacks deals an extra 2 points of damage against inanimate objects and constructs. (Knowledge [architecture and engineering] 4 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																										SOURCEPAGE:p.98
Deadly Strike			KEY:Tactical Combat ~ Deadly Strike				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Tactical Combat Class Feature.SpecialQuality										PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Nature)=4	PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (nature)=4																										DESC:You gain a +2 bonus on attack rolls made to confirm critical hits. (Knowledge [nature] 4 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																				SOURCEPAGE:p.98
Discern Weakness			KEY:Tactical Combat ~ Discern Weakness			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Tactical Combat Class Feature.SpecialQuality										PRESKILL:1,TYPE.Knowledge=5																																	DESC:Choose one creature type from the ranger's favored enemy list (PH 47). Provided that you have at least 5 ranks in the appropriate Knowledge skill (Knowledge [arcana] for dragons, Knowledge [nature] for humanoids, and so forth), you gain a +2 bonus on attack rolls against creatures of that type. You can select this ability multiple times, choosing a different creature type each time. (Knowledge [varies] 5 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																															SOURCEPAGE:p.98
Mystical Augmentation		KEY:Tactical Combat ~ Mystical Augmentation		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Tactical Combat Class Feature.SpecialQuality										PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Religion)=4	PRESKILL:1,KnowleDge (Religion)=4																										DESC:Choose one clerical domain. The effective caster level of any spell in that domain cast upon you by someone else increases by 1, if you so choose at the time of casting. (Knowledge [religion] 4 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																		SOURCEPAGE:p.98
Physical Augmentation		KEY:Tactical Combat ~ Physical Augmentation		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Tactical Combat Class Feature.SpecialQuality										PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Nature)=6	PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Nature)=6																										DESC:Choose one of your physical ability scores (Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution). When any spell that applies a bonus or penalty to this score is cast upon you by someone else, any bonus granted increases by 2, and any penalty imposed is reduced by 2 (minimum penalty 1). You can select this ability multiple times, choosing a different ability score each time. (Knowledge [nature] 6 ranks)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																		SOURCEPAGE:p.98
Resist Ethos			KEY:Tactical Combat ~ Resist Ethos				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Tactical Combat Class Feature.SpecialQuality										PRESKILL:2,Knowledge (Religion)=5,Knowledge (the Planes)=5	PRESKILL:1,KnowleDge (Religion)=5,Knowledge (the Planes)=5																		DESC:You gain a +2 bonus on all saving throws against negative energy-based spells, and against spells with an alignment subtype opposed to one or both aspects of your own alignment (law/chaos or good/evil). (Knowledge [religion or the planes] 5)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																											SOURCEPAGE:p.98
Spell Disruptor			KEY:Tactical Combat ~ Spell Disruptor			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Tactical Combat Class Feature.SpecialQuality										PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Arcana)=6	PRESKILL:1,Knowledge (Arcana)=6																										DESC:Any spellcaster flanked by you and an ally cannot cast defensively to avoid attacks of opportunity and is aware of this limitation. (Knowledge [arcana] 6)																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																										SOURCEPAGE:p.98

# Sanctified One
Weapon and Armor Proficiency	KEY:Sanctified One ~ Weapon and Armor Proficiency	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																															DESC:If you are not already proficient with the chosen weapon of your deity, you gain that proficiency now. You gain no other armor or weapon proficiencies.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																														AUTO:WEAPONPROF|DEITYWEAPONS																																																																																																																																																																								SOURCEPAGE:p.99
Spellcasting			KEY:Sanctified One ~ Spellcasting				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																															DESC:At 2nd and 4th level, you gain new spells per day and an increase in caster level (and spells known, if applicable) as if you had also gained a level in a spell casting class to which you belonged before adding the prestige class level. You do not, however, gain any other benefit a character of that class would have gained. If you had more than one spellcasting class before becoming a sanctified one, you must decide to which class to add each level for the purpose of determining spells per day, caster level, and spells known.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																											SOURCEPAGE:p.100
# Cannot do without code support
Additional Class Skills		KEY:Sanctified One ~ Additional Class Skills		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:Upon becoming a sanctified one, you gain the additional class skills specified for your deity in the accompanying table.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																SOURCEPAGE:p.100
Sanctified Ability		KEY:Sanctified One ~ Sanctified Ability			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality																														DEFINE:SanctifiedAbilityPool|0												DESC:At 1st, 3rd, and 5th level, you can choose a sanctified ability corresponding to your deity from the accompanying table. Sanctified abilities can be extraordinary, spell-like, or supernatural, as designated in their individual descriptions. If a sanctified ability is followed by an asterisk (*), you can select it as many times as you wish. Each time you choose it, the number of times per day that you can use that ability increases by one.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																			ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Sanctified One ~ Ehlonna|PREDEITY:1,Ehlonna	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Sanctified One ~ Kord|PREDEITY:1,Kord	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Sanctified One ~ Olidammara|PREDEITY:1,Olidammara	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Sanctified One ~ Wee Jas|PREDEITY:1,Wee Jas																																																																																																BONUS:VAR|SanctifiedAbilityPool|(SanctifiedOneLVL+1)/2											SOURCEPAGE:p.100
Sanctified Blessing		KEY:Sanctified One ~ Sanctified Blessing			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																															DESC:At 5th level, you receive a sanctified blessing based on your deity's powers and portfolio, as given on the accompanying table. Sanctified One Abilities The abilities to which you have access as a sanctified one are summarized on the accompanying table and described below, in the order they appear on the table.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																									ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Sanctified Blessing ~ Fast Healing|PREDEITY:1,Ehlonna	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Sanctified Blessing ~ Blessing of Kord|PREDEITY:1,Kord	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Sanctified Blessing ~ Fast Talk|PREDEITY:1,Olidammara	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Sanctified Blessing ~ Ruby Spell|PREDEITY:1,Wee Jas																																																																																																												SOURCEPAGE:p.100
#
Ehlonna				KEY:Sanctified One ~ Ehlonna					CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																															DESC:As a sanctified one of Ehlonna, you gain abilities relating to light, life, and nature.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																					SOURCEPAGE:p.100
Light of Life			KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Light of Life			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality			PREDEITY:1,Ehlonna																																						DESC:Once per day as a standard action, you can call upon Ehlonna's light to create a consecrated area. This effect works like the consecrate spell, except that the effect is mobile and centered upon you. In addition, you are treated as an altar of Ehlonna for the purpose of determining the bonuses granted. This effect lasts for 10 minutes.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																											SOURCEPAGE:p.100
Nature's Bounty			KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Nature's Bounty			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality				PREDEITY:1,Ehlonna																																						DESC:Once per day, you can use heroes' feast (caster level equals 6 + your sanctified one level). Instead of producing tables and chairs, however, this ability produces blankets and pallets more suited to an outdoor setting.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																															SOURCEPAGE:p.100
Nature's Holding			KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Nature's Holding			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality				PREDEITY:1,Ehlonna																																						DESC:Once per day, by touching a plant or a natural earth or stone surface, you create an opening to an extradimensional space similar to that created by a rope trick spell. When you and your allies enter this space and close the "door," no evidence of the opening exists on the outside. The space remains for 12 hours or until the last creature exits, whichever comes first.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																						SOURCEPAGE:p.100
Summon Nature's Mount		KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Summon Nature's Mount		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality				PREDEITY:1,Ehlonna																																						DESC:Once per day as a swift action, you can summon either a unicorn or a griffon (your choice) to serve as your mount. For each sanctified one level you possess, the creature gains 2 Hit Dice and a +2 sacred bonus to its AC. The mount is immune to fear effects, and it remains for 1 hour or until slain. You gain a +5 bonus on Ride checks while riding this creature.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																							SOURCEPAGE:p.100
Fast Healing			KEY:Sanctified Blessing ~ Fast Healing			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:Once per day as an immediate action, you can gain fast healing 5, which lasts for 10 rounds.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																				SOURCEPAGE:p.100
#
Kord					KEY:Sanctified One ~ Kord					CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																														DESC:As a sanctified one of Kord, you gain abilities relating to strength and chaos.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																						SOURCEPAGE:p.100
Chaos Warp				KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Chaos Warp				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality			PREDEITY:1,Kord																																							DESC:Once per day, you can completely ignore all damage from one critical hit scored against you, as well as any effects relating to it.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																														SOURCEPAGE:p.100
Holy Fire				KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Holy Fire				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality			PREDEITY:1,Kord																																							DESC:Whenever you cast a spell with the fire subtype, you can choose to change all the fire damage it deals into raw divine damage that is treated as good-aligned for the purpose of overcoming damage reduction. This choice must be made at the time of casting.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																									SOURCEPAGE:p.100
Luck of Battle			KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Luck of Battle			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality			PREDEITY:1,Kord																																							DESC:Once per day, you can choose to roll twice for any roll normally requiring 1d20 and use the higher of the two results.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																SOURCEPAGE:p.100
Sanctified Strength		KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Sanctified Strength		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality			PREDEITY:1,Kord																																							DESC:Once per day, you can apply twice your sanctified one level as a sacred bonus to your Strength for 1 round.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																		SOURCEPAGE:p.100
Blessing of Kord			KEY:Sanctified Blessing ~ Blessing of Kord		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At dawn every day, you can choose one of the following blessings of Kord, which lasts for 24 hours: +2 bonus to Strength, +2 luck bonus on all saves, or +10-foot bonus to speed. You cannot change this blessing until the next day.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																													SOURCEPAGE:p.100
#
Olidammara				KEY:Sanctified One ~ Olidammara				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																														DESC:As a sanctified one of Olidammara, you gain abilities relating to luck and stealth.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																						SOURCEPAGE:p.101
Chaos Luck				KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Chaos Luck				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality			PREDEITY:1,Olidammara																																						DESC:Once per day as an immediate action, you can grant yourself and each of your allies within 30 feet the evasion ability for 1 round. Any recipient of this benefit who already has evasion gains improved evasion instead. Any recipient who already has improved evasion gains no further benefit.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																			SOURCEPAGE:p.101
Good Catch				KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Good Catch				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality			PREDEITY:1,Olidammara																																						DESC:Whenever you make a Disable Device check, you can choose to roll a second time before learning the result of your check. If you do so, you must use the result of your second attempt.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																					SOURCEPAGE:p.101
Not in the Face			KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Not in the Face			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality			PREDEITY:1,Olidammara																																						DESC:Once per day as an immediate action, you can apply your base Reflex save as a bonus to your Armor Class for 1 minute. Whenever you are denied your Dexterity bonus, you lose this bonus as well.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																				SOURCEPAGE:p.101
Rogues' Blessing			KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Rogues' Blessing			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality			PREDEITY:1,Olidammara																																						DESC:If you have the sneak attack ability, you gain an extra 1d8 points of sneak attack damage for every two sanctified one levels you possess.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																													SOURCEPAGE:p.101
Fast Talk				KEY:Sanctified Blessing ~ Fast Talk				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike.Class Feature.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:Once per combat encounter, you can make a Diplomacy check as an immediate action to prevent an enemy within 10 feet from attacking you. The foe must be attempting an attack against you at the time you use this ability. If your Diplomacy check result exceeds your opponent's Sense Motive check result by at least 1 for every 3 points of base attack bonus the enemy character possesses, he decides not to attack you (or anyone else) this round. In subsequent rounds, he attacks you only if you attack him first or are the only opponent within sight. If your Diplomacy check fails, the opponent attacks normally, and you cannot use this ability again during this combat encounter.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																			SOURCEPAGE:p.101
#
Wee Jas				KEY:Sanctified One ~ Wee Jas					CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																															DESC:As a sanctified one of Wee Jas, you gain abilities relating to death, law, and spellcasting.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																				SOURCEPAGE:p.101
Armor of Law			KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Armor of Law			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality			PREDEITY:1,Wee Jas																																						DESC:If you have an armor bonus (permanent or temporary), it increases by an amount equal to your class level. If you have no armor bonus, you can increase your shield bonus instead. If you have neither, you gain no benefit.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																															SOURCEPAGE:p.101
Death's Cloak			KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Death's Cloak			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality			PREDEITY:1,Wee Jas																																						DESC:Once per day as a swift action, you can render yourself immune to poison, magic sleep effects, paralysis, stunning, disease, and death effects for 1 minute.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																										SOURCEPAGE:p.101
Sanctified Fall			KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Sanctified Fall			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality			PREDEITY:1,Wee Jas																																						DESC:If you are reduced to -1 or fewer hit points, or even killed outright by a death effect, you can use an immediate action to either cast a spell or make a single attack. For this action only, you can increase your either your effective caster level or your bonus on attack rolls (your decision) by an amount equal to your sanctified one level.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																											SOURCEPAGE:p.101
Sanctified Spell			KEY:Sanctified Ability ~ Sanctified Spell			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Sanctified Ability.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality			PREDEITY:1,Wee Jas																																						DESC:Once per day, you can increase your effective caster level by an amount equal to your Intelligence bonus (if any) for 1 round.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																															SOURCEPAGE:p.101
Ruby Spell				KEY:Sanctified Blessing ~ Ruby Spell			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike.Class Feature.Sanctified One Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:Choose a spell that you can cast from the highest level to which you have access. You can now use this spell as a spell-like ability once per day. Doing so requires no material components, unless those components have a gold piece cost equal to 100 gp or more. You can also still cast this spell normally as part of your normal spell repertoire. Each time you gain a new spellcasting level, you can either retain this spell as a spell-like ability or choose a different one from the highest level you can cast.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																															SOURCEPAGE:p.101

# Shadowspy
Spellcasting			KEY:Shadowspy ~ Spellcasting					CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Shadowspy Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																																DESC:At each even-numbered level, you gain new spells per day and an increase in caster level (and spells known, if applicable) as if you had also gained a level in a spellcasting class to which you belonged before adding the prestige class level. You do not, however, gain any other benefit a character of that class would have gained. If you had more than one divine spellcasting class before becoming a shadowspy, you must decide to which class to add each level for the purpose of determining spells per day, caster level, and spells known.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																										SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Aura of Anonymity			KEY:Shadowspy ~ Aura of Anonymity				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Shadowspy Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																														DESC:You leave few impressions upon those you meet, and even fewer upon those unexceptional souls you pass in the street. When you are walking in a crowd of ten or more individuals, you gain a divine bonus equal to your shadowspy level on Disguise and Hide checks.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																													BONUS:SKILL|Disguise,Hide|ShadowspyLVL																					SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Radiance of Pelor			KEY:Shadowspy ~ Radiance of Pelor				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Shadowspy Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																														DESC:Pelor has granted you the power to enhance sources of light so that they shine as brightly as the sun. As a swift action, you can augment any or all light sources within 60 feet (including torches, lamps, lanterns, and campfires, as well as objects that are the target of a light spell and magic weapons that glow). The range of any light source so affected doubles, and the effect lasts a number of hours equal to your shadowspy level, or until the light source is extinguished, whichever occurs first. This ability can be used a number of times per day equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum once).																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Bonus Feat				KEY:Shadowspy ~ Bonus Feat					CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Shadowspy Class Feature.SpecialQuality																															DEFINE:ShadowspyFeatPool|0													DESC:At 2nd level and every 3rd level thereafter, you can select a bonus feat for which you meet the prerequisites from the following list: Acrobatic, Alertness, Athletic, Combat Casting, Deceitful, Extra Turning, Improved Turning, Investigator, Good Devotion (see page 58), Persuasive, Stealthy.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																															BONUS:VAR|ShadowspyFeatPool|(ShadowspyLVL+1)/3													SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Immunity to Blindness		KEY:Shadowspy ~ Immunity to Blindness			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Shadowspy Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																														DESC:Beginning at 2nd level, you cannot be blinded by magical effects, spells, or bright light. Physical barriers to sight, such as blindfolds and solid objects, still prevent you from seeing. Additionally, any wounds that cause the destruction of your eyes still blind you.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																							SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Veil of Pelor			KEY:Shadowspy ~ Veil of Pelor					CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike.Class Feature.Shadowspy Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																														DESC:When you attain 3rd level, your motives and morality become almost impossible to determine. As an immediate action, you can use undetectable alignment, as the spell (caster level equals your character level). This ability is usable at will.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																												SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Personal Eclipse			KEY:Shadowspy ~ Personal Eclipse				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Shadowspy Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																														DESC:Beginning at 4th level, you can manipulate the direction and intensity of light. By redirecting and dimming ambient illumination, you can cast shadows around your body to better conceal your presence. Doing so grants you a circumstance bonus equal to one-half your shadowspy level on Hide checks. This ability can be used at will but is effective only in areas where light is present.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																				SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Truth of the Light		KEY:Shadowspy ~ Truth of the Light				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike.Class Feature.Shadowspy Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																			SPELLS:TIMES=ShadowspyLVL|TIMES=1|CASTERLEVEL=ShadowspyLVL|Zone of Truth	DESC:When you attain 6th level, creatures in your company find it difficult to tell deliberate untruths. At will, you can use zone of truth, as the spell (caster level equals your character level). You can use this ability a number of times per day equal to your shadowspy level.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																						SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Blinding Light			KEY:Shadowspy ~ Blinding Light				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Shadowspy Class Feature.SpecialQuality																													DEFINE:BlindingLightDC|0													DESC:At 7th level, you learn to blind nearby foes with a brief but intense flash of light. Twice per day, you can project a beam of light from your palm in a cone-shaped burst with a range of 15 feet. Any creature in the area that fails a Reflex save DC %1 (DC 10 + shadowspy level + Wis modifier) is blinded for 1d6 rounds. Sightless creatures are not affected by this ability.|BlindingLightDC																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																												ABILITY:Ability Focus|AUTOMATIC|Blinding Light																																																																																																																																												BONUS:VAR|BlindingLightDC|2|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Ability Focus (Blinding Light)	BONUS:VAR|BlindingLightDC|10+ShadowspyLVL+WIS	SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Sun's Revelation			KEY:Shadowspy ~ Sun's Revelation				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Shadowspy Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																														DESC:At 8th level, you become adept at detecting untruths spoken in your presence. At will, you can use discern lies, as the spell (caster level equals your character level).																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																							SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Hide in Plain Sight		KEY:Shadowspy ~ Hide in Plain Sight				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Shadowspy Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																														DESC:Beginning at 9th level, you can use the Hide skill even while being observed, as long as you are in a sunlit location. See the ranger class feature (PH 48).																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																										SOURCEPAGE:p.106
Vision of Pelor			KEY:Shadowspy ~ Vision of Pelor				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Shadowspy Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																			SPELLS:Innate|TIMES=3|CASTERLEVEL=ShadowspyLVL|True Seeing		DESC:At 10th level, you can see through even the most potent illusions. Three times per day, you can use true seeing at will, as the spell (caster level equals your character level).																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																						SOURCEPAGE:p.106

# Shadowstriker
Badge of Office			KEY:Shadowstriker ~ Badge of Office				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Shadowstriker Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:Upon your induction into the shadowstrikers, you were given a special holy symbol combining the symbols of Heironeous and Pelor. This item is crafted from gold, inlaid with platinum lightning motifs, and encrusted with sunstones. In areas where the Church of Heironeous or the Church of Pelor holds political power, this badge allows you access to prohibited areas and gives you the right to detain and question suspects in the pursuit of your deity's will.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																							SOURCEPAGE:p.108
Luminous Weapon			KEY:Shadowstriker ~ Luminous Weapon				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Shadowstriker Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:You can imbue your melee weapon with the power of the Shining One. When you do so, your weapon glows as if affected by a light spell and gains a bonus equal to twice your shadowstriker level on damage rolls against evil and/or undead creatures. You can use this ability a number of times per day equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum once), and the effect lasts for 10 rounds.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																					SOURCEPAGE:p.108
Smite Evil				KEY:Shadowstriker ~ Smite Evil				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Shadowstriker Class Feature.SpecialQuality.Smite Evil																																													DESC:Beginning at 2nd level, you can smite evil once per day (see the paladin class feature, PH 44). Smite evil attempts/day attained from multiple sources stack.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																		ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Smite Evil																																																																																																																																												BONUS:VAR|SmiteEvilTimes|1																SOURCEPAGE:p.108
Sun's Blessing			KEY:Shadowstriker ~ Sun's Blessing				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Shadowstriker Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:When you reach 2nd level, you can cause your weapon to flare with the fires of the sun. As long as the sun's blessing remains upon your luminous weapon, it deals an extra 1d6 points of fire damage. Additionally, the blinding light spilling from the weapon counts as a daylight spell for the duration of the effect. The sun's blessing can be used once per day, and the effect lasts for a number of rounds equal to your shadowstriker level. You can gain an additional use per day of this ability for each daily turn attempt, smite evil attempt, or spell slot (if you are a spontaneous caster) that you sacrifice.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																														SOURCEPAGE:p.108
Surge of Piety			KEY:Shadowstriker ~ Surge of Piety				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Shadowstriker Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:When you attain 3rd level as a shadowstriker, your touch becomes infused with positive energy. Any undead creature that touches you (by hitting you in melee or for any other reason) is shaken for 1 round or until it is no longer in physical contact with you-even if it normally can't be affected by this condition. Once per day as a fullround action, you can channel this energy into a single burst of positive energy, which manifests as a flash of bright, warm sunlight. In addition to functioning as a consecrate spell, this wave of energy deals 1d8 points of positive energy damage to every undead creature within 30 feet (no save). You can increase the damage this effect deals by 1d8 points (maximum +5d8) for each daily turn attempt, smite evil attempt, or spell slot (if you are a spontaneous caster) that you sacrifice.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																										SOURCEPAGE:p.108

# Squire Of Legend
Spellcasting			KEY:Squire of Legend ~ Spellcasting				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Squire Of Legend Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																															DESC:At 2nd and 3rd level, you gain new spells per day and an increase in caster level (and spells known, if applicable) as if you had also gained a level in a spellcasting class to which you belonged before adding the prestige class level. You do not, however, gain any other benefit a character of that class would have gained. If you had more than one spellcasting class before becoming a squire of legend, you must decide to which class to add each level for the purpose of determining spells per day, caster level, and spells known.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																											SOURCEPAGE:p.110
Paragon's Path			KEY:Squire of Legend ~ Paragon's Path			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Class Feature.Squire Of Legend Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																															DESC:Upon becoming a squire of legend, you must choose one of the legendary Six from Shadow after whom to model your skills and abilities. Once made, your choice cannot be changed.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																						SOURCEPAGE:p.110
Save Bonus				KEY:Squire of Legend ~ Save Bonus				CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Squire Of Legend Class Feature.SpecialQuality																											DEFINE:SquireOfLegendSaveBonus|0												DESC:At 1st level, you gain a +1 bonus on a saving throw determined by your paragon, as given on the following table. This bonus increases to +2 when you attain 3rd level.	DESC:&nl;Patron Saving Throw	DESC:&nl;Dardallion Reflex|PREDEITY:1,Dardallion	DESC:&nl;Imdastri Will|PREDEITY:1,Imdastri	DESC:&nl;Ktolemagne Will|PREDEITY:1,Ktolemagne	DESC:&nl;Orsos Fortitude|PREDEITY:1,Orsos	DESC:&nl;Reikhardt Will|PREDEITY:1,Reikhardt	DESC:&nl;Sunyartra Fortitude|PREDEITY:1,Sunyartra																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																		BONUS:SAVE|Reflex|SquireOfLegendSaveBonus|PREDEITY:1,Dardallion	BONUS:SAVE|Fortitude|SquireOfLegendSaveBonus|PREDEITY:1,Orsos,Sunyartra	BONUS:SAVE|Will|SquireOfLegendSaveBonus|PREDEITY:1,Imdastri,Ktolemagne,Reikhardt								BONUS:VAR|SquireOfLegendSaveBonus|1+(SquireOfLegend>2)											SOURCEPAGE:p.110
Squire's Burden, Least		KEY:Squire of Legend ~ Squire's Burden (Least)		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Squire Of Legend Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:You gain the first of several supernatural abilities that let you use the skills of your chosen paragon to aid others. Unless otherwise noted, each paragon's gift (least, lesser, and greater) requires a swift action to invoke, lasts for a number of rounds equal to twice your squire of legend level, is usable once per day, and has a caster level equal to three times your squire of legend level. When the description of a squire's burden ability specifies an ally, it means only an ally; you cannot use the effect on yourself unless so stated.	DESC:&nl;Dardallion: You can grant yourself and one ally flanking bonuses against a foe that both of you threaten, even if you are not properly positioned to flank. The bonus persists as long as you both threaten that enemy.	DESC:&nl;Imdastri: You can use sanctuary, as the spell.	DESC:&nl;Ktolemagne: You can use comprehend languages, as the spell.	DESC:&nl;Orsos: You can use speak with animals, as the spell.	DESC:&nl;Reikhardt: You can grant one ally within 30 feet the ability to take an immediate action of a specified type out of turn. If you invoke this ability as a swift action, the ally can take a 5-foot step. If you invoke it as a move action, she can take a move action. If you invoke it as a standard action, she can take a standard action.	DESC:&nl;Sunyartra: As an immediate action, you can negate a single critical hit against one ally within 30 feet. The ally still takes normal damage from the hit.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																												SOURCEPAGE:p.110
Squire's Burden, Lesser		KEY:Squire of Legend ~ Squire's Burden (Lesser)		CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Squire Of Legend Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At 2nd level, you gain a new supernatural ability that you can use once per day. This ability follows all the guidelines for least squire's burden (above), unless otherwise noted. If you choose, you can forgo your daily use of this ability for an extra use of your least squire's burden.	DESC:&nl;Dardallion: As an immediate action, you can grant one ally within 30 feet the opportunity to reroll a saving throw, skill check, or ability check.	DESC:&nl;Imdastri: You can use shield other, as the spell. The effect lasts for a number of rounds equal to three times your squire of legend level.|PREDEITY:1,Imdastri	DESC:&nl;Ktolemagne: You can use see invisibility, as the spell. The effect lasts for a number of rounds equal to three times your squire of legend level.|PREDEITY:1,Ktolemagne	DESC:&nl;Orsos: You can use lesser restoration, as the spell.|PREDEITY:1,Orsos	DESC:&nl;Reikhardt: You can grant an ally within 30 feet a second use of an extraordinary or supernatural ability normally usable only once per day. If you gain a second daily use of this ability, you cannot use it twice in one day on the same ally.|PREDEITY:1,Reikhardt	DESC:&nl;Sunyartra: You can use true strike, as the spell, but only on a single ally within 30 feet.|PREDEITY:1,Sunyartra																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																														SOURCEPAGE:p.110
Faithful Companion		KEY:Squire of Legend ~ Faithful Companion			CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary.Class Feature.Squire Of Legend Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																												DESC:At 3rd level, you learn to place yourself between an ally and harm. If you and an ally within 5 feet are both subject to an area spell or effect that allows a Reflex save for partial damage, you can grant your ally a bonus on her saving throw by taking a penalty of equivalent magnitude on your own. The value of the bonus and penalty can be any amount up to the value of your base Reflex saving throw. You must decide to invoke this ability before either you or your ally has attempted the saving throw.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																SOURCEPAGE:p.110
Squire's Burden, Greater	KEY:Squire of Legend ~ Squire's Burden (Greater)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural.Class Feature.Squire Of Legend Class Feature.SpecialQuality																																													DESC:At 3rd level, you gain a new supernatural ability you can use once per day. It follows all the guidelines for least squire's burden, above. If you choose, you can forgo your daily use of this ability for an extra use of the least or lesser squire's burden.	DESC:&nl;Dardallion: You can grant one ally within 30 feet the ability to move through threatened areas without provoking attacks of opportunity for 2 rounds. Other actions, such as casting in a threatened area, still provoke attacks of opportunity as normal.|PREDEITY:1,Dardallion	DESC:&nl;Imdastri: You can grant one ally within 30 feet immunity to one of the following effects for a number of rounds equal to three times your squire of legend level: disease, exhaustion/ fatigue, mind-affecting spells and abilities, negative levels, or poison. You choose the effect when you activate this ability.|PREDEITY:1,Imdastri	DESC:&nl;Ktolemagne: As a swift action, you can take over concentrating to maintain an ally's spell or spell-like ability, allowing her to take other actions. Once you have assumed control of an effect, you cannot give it back.|PREDEITY:1,Ktolemagne	DESC:&nl;Orsos: You can grant one ally within 30 feet energy resistance 10 to an energy type of your choice for a number of rounds equal to three times your squire of legend level.|PREDEITY:1,Orsos	DESC:&nl;Reikhardt: When an ally within 30 feet of you uses an extraordinary, spell-like, or supernatural ability that affects all allies within a given number of feet, you can use an immediate action to extend its range and duration by 50%%.|PREDEITY:1,Reikhardt	DESC:&nl;Sunyartra: As an immediate action, you can grant one ally within 30 feet the opportunity to reroll an attack roll or critical hit confirmation roll.|PREDEITY:1,Sunyartra																																																																																																																																																																																												SOURCEPAGE:p.111


###Block: ACF
# Ability Name		Unique Key						SORTKEY		Category of Ability	Type							Multiple Requirements													Var. Min. Value			Define					Description																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																													Ability																																																																																																													Bonus Ability Pool																																																	Bonus to spell cast/day																													Modify VAR															Cost				Source Page
Spiritual Totem		KEY:Barbarian ACF ~ Spiritual Totem		SORTKEY:Barbarian	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF.BarbarianFastMovement																		PREVARGTEQ:BarbarianLVL,1							DESC:You gain one of the abilities described below, depending on the chosen totem. Each of these effects is a supernatural ability.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																									ABILITY:Internal|AUTOMATIC|Barbarian ACF Totem Selection	ABILITY:Barbarian Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Spiritual Totem ~ Bear|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Barbarian ACF Totem (Bear)	ABILITY:Barbarian Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Spiritual Totem ~ Eagle|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Barbarian ACF Totem (Eagle)	ABILITY:Barbarian Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Spiritual Totem ~ Fox|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Barbarian ACF Totem (Fox)	ABILITY:Barbarian Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Spiritual Totem ~ Lion|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Barbarian ACF Totem (Lion)	ABILITY:Barbarian Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Spiritual Totem ~ Wolf|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Barbarian ACF Totem (Wolf)																																																																																																									COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.46



Totem Manifestation	KEY:Barbarian ACF ~ Totem Manifestation	SORTKEY:Barbarian	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF.BarbarianDamageReduction																		PREVARGTEQ:BarbarianLVL,7																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																					ABILITY:Internal|AUTOMATIC|Barbarian ACF Totem Selection	ABILITY:Barbarian Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Totem Manifestation ~ Bear|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Barbarian ACF Totem (Bear)	ABILITY:Barbarian Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Totem Manifestation ~ Eagle|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Barbarian ACF Totem (Eagle)	ABILITY:Barbarian Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Totem Manifestation ~ Fox|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Barbarian ACF Totem (Fox)	ABILITY:Barbarian Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Totem Manifestation ~ Lion|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Barbarian ACF Totem (Lion)	ABILITY:Barbarian Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Totem Manifestation ~ Wolf|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Internal,Barbarian ACF Totem (Wolf)																																																																																																					COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.46
View the Spirit World	KEY:Barbarian ACF ~ View the Spirit World	SORTKEY:Barbarian	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF.BarbarianImprovedUncannyDodge																	PREVARGTEQ:BarbarianLVL,5							DESC: Once per day, you can peer into the spirit world for a number of rounds equal to one-half your barbarian level (rounded down). While doing so, you gain darkvision out to 60 feet, can see invisible creatures, and gain a +2 bonus on Search and Spot checks. This is a supernatural ability.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.46

Healing Hymn		KEY:Bard ACF ~ Healing Hymn			SORTKEY:Bard	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF.BardFascinate																				PREVARGTEQ:BardLVL,1								DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces the fascinate bardic music ability.If you have 3 or more ranks in a Perform skill, you can use your music or poetics to create an area conducive to healing. To be affected, an ally must be able to see and hear you perform. The effect lasts as long as you continue performing and for 5 rounds thereafter. An affected ally who casts any conjuration (healing) spell gains a +1 sacred (if you're good or neutral) or profane (if you're evil) bonus on the roll for each rank you have in the Perform skill. This ability has no effect on spells cast from wands, scrolls, or other magic items. In addition, if you use this ability for 1 full minute before you and your allies retire for the night, everyone in the group heals naturally as if he had completed 24 hours of bed rest (thus recovering twice his character level in hit points). If the music is interrupted, the magic of the song is lost. Either use of healing hymn counts as one daily use of your bardic music ability. This is a spell-like ability.																																																																																																																																																																																																		ABILITY:Bard Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Bard ACF ~ Healing Hymn																																																																																																																																																																																																									COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.47

Hymn of Fortification	KEY:Bard ACF ~ Hymn of Fortification	SORTKEY:Bard	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF.BardInspireConfidence																		PREVARGTEQ:BardLVL,3								DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces the inspire competence bardic music ability. Benefit: If you are a 3rd-level or higher bard with 6 or more ranks in Perform (oratory) or Perform (sing), you can grant protection from supernatural creatures. This effect fortifies you or a single chosen ally within 30 feet against mental control and attacks from evil-aligned or summoned creatures. In most respects, hymn of fortification mirrors the effects of the protection from evil spell. If you wish to protect an ally with this ability, the two of you must be able to see and hear each other. The effect lasts as long as you concentrate, up to a maximum of 2 minutes. Each use of hymn of fortification counts as one daily use of your bardic music ability. This is a spell-like ability.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																													ABILITY:Bard Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Bard ACF ~ Hymn of Fortification																																																																																																																																																																																																							COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.47
# Cleric
Pool of Healing		KEY:Cleric ACF ~ Pool of Healing		SORTKEY:Cleric	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF																						PREVARGTEQ:ClericLVL,7								DESC:Replaces: To select this class feature, you must permanently sacrifice one of your 4th-level spell slots. Benefit: You establish a pool of positive energy that you can use to heal yourself or others. This pool contains enough positive energy to heal an amount of damage equal to 5 x (1 + your divine caster level) hit points per day. You can dole it out with a touch, expending as much or as little of the pool at a time as you wish in much the same way as a paladin does with her lay on hands ability. The pool automatically replenishes every time you prepare spells for the day. You can also deal out this positive energy with a melee touch attack against any creature vulnerable to positive energy (such as undead), damaging it as if you had cast a cure spell upon it. Example: Jozan, a 7th-level cleric of Pelor, gives up one of his 4th-level spell slots to set up his pool of healing. Every day, he can heal up to 5 x (1 + 7) = 40 points of damage, or deal that amount of damage to creatures powered by negative energy, or use the energy for a combination of those effects, up to the maximum available. At 10th level, he can heal up to 55 points of damage using this ability. Pool of healing is a spell-like ability.																																																																																																																																																																		ABILITY:Cleric Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Cleric ACF ~ Pool of Healing																																																																																																																																																								BONUS:SPELLCAST|CLASS=Cleric;LEVEL=4|-1																																										COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.47
# Fighter
Aligned Strike		KEY:Fighter ACF ~ Aligned Strike		SORTKEY:Fighter	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF																						PREVARGTEQ:FighterLVL,4								DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces one of your fighter bonus feats. Benefit: As a free action, you can orient your weapon along one alignment component that you possess. For example, if you are chaotic good, you can make your weapon either chaotic- or good-aligned for the purpose of overcoming damage reduction. This effect lasts until you choose to end it or change it (as a free action) to the other alignment component, or until you no longer wield the weapon. Ammunition or a thrown weapon affected by this ability remains aligned until it either strikes a target or misses. Aligned strike is a supernatural ability.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																							ABILITY:Fighter Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Fighter ACF ~ Aligned Strike																																																																																																																																																																																								BONUS:VAR|Pool_FighterFeat|-1												COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.47
Armor of God		KEY:Fighter ACF ~ Armor of God		SORTKEY:Fighter	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF																						PREVARGTEQ:FighterLVL,8								DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces one of your fighter bonus feats. Benefit: As an immediate action, you can reduce your base Will save to +0 and gain a bonus to your Armor Class equal to the amount of the reduction. This effect lasts until the beginning of your next turn. Armor of god is a supernatural ability.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																										ABILITY:Fighter Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Fighter ACF ~ Armor of God																																																																																																																																																																																								BONUS:VAR|Pool_FighterFeat|-1												COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.47
Resolute			KEY:Fighter ACF ~ Resolute			SORTKEY:Fighter	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF																						PREVARGTEQ:FighterLVL,2								DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces one of your fighter bonus feats. Benefit: As an immediate action, you can reduce your base attack bonus by one-half and gain a bonus on your Will save equal to the amount of the reduction. This effect lasts until the end of your next action. This is a super natural ability.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																											ABILITY:Fighter Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Fighter ACF ~ Resolute																																																																																																																																																																																									BONUS:VAR|Pool_FighterFeat|-1												COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.47
# Monk
Holy Strike			KEY:Monk ACF ~ Holy Strike			SORTKEY:Monk	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF																						PREVARGTEQ:MonkLVL,4								DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces the ki strike (magic) class feature. Benefit: When you hit an evil creature with your unarmed strike attack or with a monk melee weapon, your attack is considered good-aligned for the purpose of overcoming damage reduction and deals an extra 1d6 points of damage. Holy strike is a supernatural ability. Special: Evil monks can select this ability, but their attacks are considered evil-aligned for the purpose of overcoming damage reduction.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																															ABILITY:Monk Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Monk ACF ~ Holy Strike																																																																																																																																																																																																									COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.47
Prayerful Meditation	KEY:Monk ACF ~ Prayerful Meditation		SORTKEY:Monk	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF.MonkStillMind																				PREVARGTEQ:MonkLVL,3								DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces the still mind class feature. Benefit: Your adherence to a religious path has developed in you a resistance to antithetical magic. You gain a +2 bonus on saving throws against spells and effects from chaoticaligned creatures and creatures with a moral (good/evil) alignment component opposite to yours. This is a supernatural ability.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																	ABILITY:Monk Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Monk ACF ~ Prayerful Meditation																																																																																																																																																																																																								COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.47
# Paladin
Holy Warrior		KEY:Paladin ACF ~ Holy Warrior		SORTKEY:Paladin	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF.PaladinSpellcasting																			PREVARGTEQ:PaladinLVL,1		DEFINE:Pool_HolyWariorFeat|0		DESC:Replaces: To select this class feature, you must sacrifice your spellcasting ability. Benefit: You no longer gain spells as a paladin, but you can now select a bonus feat at 4th, 8th, 11th, and 14th levels. You can select any feat from the following list for which you meet the prerequisites: any divine feat (see page 53), Cleave, Extra SmitingCW, Extra Turning, Great Cleave, Improved SmitingCD, Mounted Combat, Mounted Archery, Power Attack, Ride-By Attack, Skill Focus (Ride), Spirited Charge, and Trample. This is an extraordinary ability. Special: A paladin who selects this path can no longer use scrolls, wands, or other magic items that require access to a spell list, unless she has another spellcasting class that grants access to the appropriate spells.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																														ABILITY:Paladin Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Paladin ACF ~ Holy Warrior																																																																																																																																																								BONUS:SPELLCAST|CLASS=Paladin;LEVEL=1|-100	BONUS:SPELLCAST|CLASS=Paladin;LEVEL=2|-100	BONUS:SPELLCAST|CLASS=Paladin;LEVEL=3|-100	BONUS:SPELLCAST|CLASS=Paladin;LEVEL=4|-100	BONUS:VAR|Pool_HolyWariorFeat|(PaladinLVL>=4)+(PaladinLVL>=8)+(PaladinLVL>=11)+(PaladinLVL>=14)	COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.47
Underdark Knight		KEY:Paladin ACF ~ Underdark Knight		SORTKEY:Paladin	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF.PaladinSpecialMount																			PREVARGTEQ:PaladinLVL,5								DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces the special mount class feature. Benefit: Whenever you are underground, you can draw upon the earth to gain the following abilities. At 5th level, your base speed increases by 10 feet, and you gain a +2 circumstance bonus on Balance, Climb, and Jump checks. You also gain low-light vision that functions as long as you remain underground. If you already had low-light vision, you instead gain darkvision out to 60 feet while underground; if you already had darkvision, add 30 feet to its range. At 7th level, you can use spike stones once per day, as the spell (caster level equals your paladin level). At 12th level, you gain the earth glide extraordinary ability, which enables you to move through stone, dirt, or almost any other sort of earth except metal as easily as a fish moves through water (MM 98). If you end your movement inside earth or stone, however, you begin to suffocate (DMG 304). At 15th level, you can use dimension door, as the spell, once per day for every five paladin levels you possess (caster level equals your paladin level). You must begin and end any such movement in contact with stone or earth.																																																																																																																																																																													ABILITY:Paladin Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Paladin ACF ~ Underdark Knight																																																																																																																																																																																																								COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.47
# Ranger
Champion of the Wild	KEY:Ranger ACF ~ Champion of the Wild				CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:RangerSpellcasting.ACF																			PREVARGTEQ:RangerLVL,1		DEFINE:ChampionOfTheWildFeatCount|0	DESC:Replaces: To select this class feature, you must sacrifice your spellcasting ability. Benefit: You no longer gain spells as a ranger, but you can now select a bonus feat at 4th, 8th, 11th, and 14th levels. You can choose any feat from the following list for which you meet the prerequisites: Blind-Fight, Combat Expertise, Eyes in the Back of Your HeadCW, Improved Disarm, Improved Favored EnemyCW, Improved Feint, and Improved Trip, as well as from one of the following lists, depending on your combat style. Archery: Far Shot, Improved Precise Shot, Improved Rapid ShotCW, Manyshot, Point Blank Shot, Precise Shot, Ranged DisarmCW, Ranged PinCW, Ranged SunderCW, Sharp- ShootingCW, and Shot on the Run. Two-Weapon Combat: Greater Two-Weapon DefenseCW, Greater Two-Weapon Fighting, Improved Two-Weapon DefenseCW, Improved Two-Weapon Fighting, Two-Weapon Defense, Weapon Finesse. Special: A ranger who selects this path can no longer use scrolls, wands, or other magic items that require access to a spell list, unless he has another spellcasting class that grants access to the appropriate spells.																																																																																																																																																																																							ABILITY:Ranger Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Ranger ACF ~ Champion of the Wild																																																																																																			BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Champion of the Wild Archery Style|ChampionOfTheWildFeatCount|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Combat Style ~ Archery	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Champion of the Wild Two-Weapon Fighting Style|ChampionOfTheWildFeatCount|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Combat Style ~ Two-Weapon Fighting	BONUS:SPELLCAST|CLASS=Ranger;LEVEL=1|-100	BONUS:SPELLCAST|CLASS=Ranger;LEVEL=2|-100	BONUS:SPELLCAST|CLASS=Ranger;LEVEL=3|-100	BONUS:SPELLCAST|CLASS=Ranger;LEVEL=4|-100					BONUS:VAR|ChampionOfTheWildFeatCount|(RangerLVL>3)+(RangerLVL>7)+(RangerLVL>10)+(RangerLVL>13)	COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.50
Spiritual Connection	KEY:Ranger ACF ~ Spiritual Connection				CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:RangerWildEmpathy.ACF			PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Ranger=1],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.Wild Empathy]		PREVARGTEQ:RangerLVL,1								DESC:You learn to speak with spirits of the wild places. Although this ability does not automatically make such spirits well disposed toward you, it does provide several benefits. You can use speak with animals and speak with plants as the spells (caster level equals your ranger level). You can use any combination of these effects up to three times per day. This replaces Wild Empathy.	DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces the wild empathy class feature. Benefit: You can use speak with animals and speak with plants, as the spells (caster level equals your ranger level). You can use any combination of these effects up to three times per day.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																		ABILITY:Ranger Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Ranger ACF ~ Spiritual Connection	ABILITY:Ranger Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Ranger ACF ~ Spiritual Connection																																																																																																																																																																																											COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.50
Spiritual Guide		KEY:Ranger ACF ~ Spiritual Guide					CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:RangerAnimalCompanion.ACF		PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Ranger=4],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.Animal Companion]	PREVARGTEQ:RangerLVL,4		DEFINE:SGSkillBonus|0			DESC:You are befriended by a spiritual guide that speaks to you and aids you as long as you remain in the wilderness.  As long as you are in the wilderness you gain a bonus of %1 on Handle Animal, Knowledge (Nature), Listen, Search, Spot, and Survival checks. In addition you can use commune with nature, as the spell, once per day (caster level equals your ranger level). This replaces your animal companion.|SGSkillBonus	DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces the animal companion class feature. Benefit: You gain a spiritual guide. As long as you remain in natural surroundings (including underground caverns), this guide is a constant companion. Once you enter any civilized area larger than a hamlet, however, your spiritual guide leaves your side, returning only when you return to the wilds. Although it cannot protect you from harm, your spiritual guide can warn you of impending danger. As long as your spiritual guide is with you, you gain a divine bonus equal to one-quarter your ranger level (rounded down) on Handle Animal, Knowledge (nature), Listen, Search, Spot, and Survival checks. In addition, you can use commune with nature, as the spell, once per day (caster level equals your ranger level). You can also prepare and cast this spell normally from your ranger spell list.																																																																																																																																																							ABILITY:Ranger Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Ranger ACF ~ Spiritual Guide	ABILITY:Ranger Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Ranger ACF ~ Spiritual Guide																																																																																																																																																																													BONUS:VAR|SGSkillBonus|RangerLVL/4											COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.50
# Rogue
Antiquarian			KEY:Rogue ACF ~ Antiquarian						CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:RogueTrapFinding.ACF			PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Rogue=1],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.Trapfinding]		PREVARGTEQ:RogueLVL,1								DESC:You are incredibly knowledgeable about artifacts, relics, and antiques-especially those that are religious in nature. When examining magic items created with divine spells, you add your Wisdom modifier to your Appraise checks. Additionally, 1/day you can make a Knowledge (Religion) check (DC 10 + item's caster level) to identify a magic item per the identify spell with your caster level equal to your rogue level.	DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces the trapfinding class feature. Benefit: When examining divine items and religious relics, you gain a bonus equal to your Wisdom modifier on all Appraise checks as an extraordinary ability. In addition, if you examine a magic item created using a spell from the cleric or paladin list, or an item with special religious significance, you can attempt a Knowledge (religion) check (DC 10 + the item's caster level) to identify it exactly as a spell-like ability. This works like the identify spell (caster level equals your rogue level) but requires no material component. You can use this ability on only one item per day.																																																																																																																																																																																										ABILITY:Rogue Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Rogue ACF ~ Antiquarian	ABILITY:Rogue Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Rogue ACF ~ Antiquarian																																																																																																																																																																																															COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.51
Death's Ruin		KEY:Rogue ACF ~ Death's Ruin						CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:RogueTrapSense.ACF				PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Rogue=3],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.Trap Sense]		PREVARGTEQ:RogueLVL,3								DESC:You can channel the power of your faith when making sneak attacks against undead and deal 1/2 your normal sneak attack damage.  This supernatural ability replaces the trap sense class feature at all levels.	DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces the trap sense class feature, including trap sense bonuses gained at higher levels of the rogue class. Benefit: You can make sneak attacks against undead creatures. However, you roll only one-half your normal sneak attack dice (rounded down) when determining bonus damage for such attacks. This is a supernatural ability.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																															ABILITY:Rogue Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Rogue ACF ~ Death's Ruin	ABILITY:Rogue Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Rogue ACF ~ Death's Ruin																																																																																																																																																																																															COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.51
Friend's Evasion		KEY:Rogue ACF ~ Friend's Evasion		SORTKEY:Rogue	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF																						PREVARGTEQ:RogueLVL,7								DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces improved evasion as one of the rogue's special ability choices. Benefit: When you select friend's evasion as a special ability, every ally adjacent to you gains evasion. This is an extraordinary ability.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																						ABILITY:Rogue Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Rogue ACF ~ Friend's Evasion																																																																																																																																																																																																								COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.51
Holy Stalker		KEY:Rogue ACF ~ Holy Stalker			SORTKEY:Rogue	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF																						PREVARGTEQ:RogueLVL,7								DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces crippling strike as one of the rogue's special ability choices. Only non-evil rogues can select this class feature. Benefit: When you select holy stalker as a special ability, you can channel positive energy into your sneak attacks to damage undead creatures. When you successfully damage an undead creature in a situation in which you would normally apply sneak attack damage, you add 2 points of positive energy damage per sneak attack die you would normally roll. However, you still cannot roll sneak attack dice against the creature. This is a supernatural ability.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																									ABILITY:Rogue Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Rogue ACF ~ Holy Stalker																																																																																																																																																																																																									COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.51
# Sorcerer
Divine Companion		KEY:Sorcerer ACF ~ Divine Companion		SORTKEY:Sorcerer	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF																						PREVARGTEQ:SorcererLVL,1							DESC:Replaces: This benefit replaces the summon familiar class feature. Benefit: You can spend 100 gp to perform a ritual dedicated to the deity of your choice and summon forth a spirit creature to aid you in your adventures. This creature is both invisible and intangible, but it provides you with real benefits. The divine companion stores arcane energy and redirects it to you according to your level and your needs. To fill this reservoir, you must cast one or more targeted spells at this creature. A spell so cast does not produce its normal effect; the companion simply absorbs the spell's energy. It can store a number of spell levels equal to your arcane caster level. You can cast spells into it at any time, but after you rest and recover your spell slots for the day, the divine companion loses any stored energy. The divine companion exists outside reality and cannot be affected by spells, spell-like abilities, or any sort of antimagic effect or dispel check. It cannot, however, release its arcane energy within an antimagic field or similar effect. It uses your caster level for any checks required, and when it releases arcane energy, the level of the effect created equals the number of spell levels released. The divine companion can release its stored spell energy in either of the following ways, at your command. You can use each effect as often as you wish, until the companion's stored energy is depleted. Healing (Su): As a standard action, you can order your divine companion to convert the energy it has stored into healing power. This is the equivalent of a conjuration (healing) spell. This effect heals you for 1d6 points of damage per stored spell level, or as many levels as you designate (up to the maximum currently stored). Shielding (Su): As a swift action, you can order the creature to convert the energy it has stored into protecting you. This is the equivalent of an abjuration spell that provides you with a defl ection bonus to AC and a resistance bonus on saves each equal to the number of stored spell levels, or as many levels as you designate (up to the maximum currently stored). This effect lasts for 1 round per arcane caster level you possess.	ABILITY:Sorcerer Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Sorcerer ACF ~ Divine Companion																																																																																																																																																																																																								COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.51
Domain Access		KEY:Sorcerer ACF ~ Domain Access		SORTKEY:Sorcerer	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF																						PREVARGTEQ:SorcererLVL,5							DESC:Replaces: To gain this benefit, you do not learn a new 1st-level sorcerer spell and a new 2nd-level sorcerer spell at 5th level. From now on, you know one less sorcerer spell that you can cast at each subsequent level (not counting the domain spells from this alternative class feature). Benefit: Choose one cleric domain. If you worship a specific deity, the domain you choose must be one to which your deity grants access. You gain the granted power of the chosen domain. In addition, you can cast one domain spell of each spell level available to you per day from that domain.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																													ABILITY:Sorcerer Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Sorcerer ACF ~ Domain Access																																																																																																																																																																																																								COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.52
# Wizard
Spontaneous Divination	KEY:Wizard ACF ~ Spontaneous Divination	SORTKEY:Wizard	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF.WizardBonusFeats																																		DESC:You can use your connection to the divine to inquire about mysteries beyond mortal ken. Level: 5th, 10th, 15th, or 20th. Replaces: This benefit replaces the bonus feat gained by a wizard at 5th, 10th, 15th, or 20th level. Benefit: You can spontaneously cast any spell of the divination school by sacrificing a prepared spell of equal or greater level. For example, if you suddenly have need of the 2nd-level spell locate object, you can sacrifice a prepared 2nd-level spell (such as mirror image) or any prepared spell of a higher level to cast it on the spot.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																ABILITY:Wizard Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Wizard ACF ~ Spontaneous Divination																																																																																																																																																																																																							COST:0	COST:0	SOURCEPAGE:p.52
Domain Granted Power	KEY:Wizard ACF ~ Domain Granted Power	SORTKEY:Wizard	CATEGORY:ACF		TYPE:ACF.WizardBonusFeats																												DEFINE:DomainChoicePool|0		DESC:Choose one cleric domain. If you worship a specific deity, the domain you choose must be one to which your deity grants access. You now can use that domain's granted power as a cleric does, but you do not gain access to its spells or extra spell slots. Special: If you take levels in a class that grants you a domain choice (such as cleric), you gain the full benefits of the domain in addition to the other domains available to you from that class.																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																																			ABILITY:Wizard Class Feature|AUTOMATIC|Wizard ACF ~ Domain Granted Power																																																																																																																																																																																							BONUS:VAR|DomainChoicePool|1												COST:0			SOURCEPAGE:p.52




