###Block: The Temple Of The Twinkling Eye (TTE), Rank

Temple Of The Twinkling Eye Master of Names	KEY:Temple Of The Twinkling Eye ~ Master of Names	CATEGORY:Church Rank	TYPE:Temple Of The Twinkling Eye	COST:4	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Temple Of The Twinkling Eye ~ Master of Names Bonus	DESC:Gain a +2 bonus on Diplomacy checks made to avoid combat.	SOURCEPAGE:p.26

Temple Of The Twinkling Eye Master of Riddles	KEY:Temple Of The Twinkling Eye ~ Master of Riddles	CATEGORY:Church Rank	TYPE:Temple Of The Twinkling Eye	COST:9	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Church Rank,Temple Of The Twinkling Eye ~ Master of Names	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Temple Of The Twinkling Eye ~ Master of Riddles Bonus	DESC:Gain a +1 bonus on one kind of saving throw. Choose Fortitude, Reflex, or Will. Once made, this choice cannot be changed.	SOURCEPAGE:p.26

Temple Of The Twinkling Eye Master of Pranks	KEY:Temple Of The Twinkling Eye ~ Master of Pranks	CATEGORY:Church Rank	TYPE:Temple Of The Twinkling Eye	COST:6	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Church Rank,Temple Of The Twinkling Eye ~ Master of Riddles	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Temple Of The Twinkling Eye ~ Master of Pranks Bonus	DESC:Once per day, make a single Bluff or Diplomacy check as a move action without penalty.	SOURCEPAGE:p.26

Temple Of The Twinkling Eye Master of Illusion	KEY:Temple Of The Twinkling Eye ~ Master of Illusion	CATEGORY:Church Rank	TYPE:Temple Of The Twinkling Eye	COST:11	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Church Rank,Temple Of The Twinkling Eye ~ Master of Pranks	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Temple Of The Twinkling Eye ~ Master of Illusion Bonus	DESC:Once per day, make a Bluff check as a full-round action to convince an enemy you are no longer a threat. If you are successful, the creature moves to attack another target. That enemy is considered flat-footed if you make an attack against it on your next turn.	SOURCEPAGE:p.26

###Block: The Temple Of The Twinkling Eye (TTE), Bonus

