Temple Of The Twinkling Eye Master of Pranks Bonus	KEY:Temple Of The Twinkling Eye ~ Master of Pranks Bonus	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality	VISIBLE:YES	OUTPUTNAME:Temple Of The Twinkling Eye Master of Pranks	DESC:Once per day, make a single Bluff or Diplomacy check as a move action without penalty.	SOURCEPAGE:p.26

Temple Of The Twinkling Eye Master of Illusion Bonus	KEY:Temple Of The Twinkling Eye ~ Master of Illusion Bonus	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality	VISIBLE:YES	OUTPUTNAME:Temple Of The Twinkling Eye Master of Illusion	DESC:Once per day, make a Bluff check as a full-round action to convince an enemy you are no longer a threat. If you are successful, the creature moves to attack another target. That enemy is considered flat-footed if you make an attack against it on your next turn.	SOURCEPAGE:p.26


